  "instructions": [
    "place a sheet of banana leaf on a flat surface",
    "arrange 2-3 tinned tomato halves on one half of the banana leaf",
    "sprinkle salt and sugar over the tomatoes",
    "add a few chopped spring onion slices on top",
    "drizzle fish sauce and lime juice over the spring onions",
    "place a few pieces of chopped cilantro on top",
    "fold the banana leaf over the filling to enclose",
    "place the wrap on a steamer basket over boiling water",
    "steam for 5 minutes or until the banana leaf is fragrant"
